SUMMARY:Special Lecture: How Did We Get Indigenous Peoples' Day?
DESCRIPTION:The History Museum of Mobile hosts a free lecture on Monday\, 
 October 12 at 12:00 PM\, ending at 1:00 PM\, on how Indigenous Peoples' D
 ay came to be. The speaker is a professor of Native American Studies at t
